docs/patent_evaluation.md

# The content-scout worker keeps a checkout of MoltyCel/moltrust-web here to
# diff published pages against. It is a separate repository with its own
# senders and its own CI; committing it into this one would vendor the website.
workers/content_scout/.webdocs/
